  <metadata>
    <name>Gunung Sindoro via Sigedang</name>
    <desc>Gunung Sindoro via Sigedang: one-way trailhead -&gt; Gunung Sindoro from the ORIGINAL recording (OpenStreetMap), no added geometry. recording goes up one trail and down another; kept the second half (summit -&gt; end), reversed. Evidence: OSM ways named ~'sigedang': 59% of the kept half vs 3% of the dropped half within 60 m (way 1190765409 'Jalur Pendakian Gunung Sindoro via Sigedang'); dropped half lies on OSM way 'Jalur Pendakian Gunung Sindoro via Ndoroarum' (52%); note: OSM relation 17253830 'Gunung Sindoro (Sigedang Route)' covers both halves (it maps the same loop), so it is not used. OSM data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/17253830"><text>original source</text></link>
  </metadata>
